              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kenneth Briscoe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made it..ate it...loved it! I used Italian Herbs Crackers with it and made it to snack on for Thanksgiving. week while working on the heavy hitters...So quick...So easy. Recommend you put the Sun Dried Tomatoes and the Basil in the food processor together...so much faster &amp; easier!",
